  {
    "name": "ClimateControl",
    "description": "Control vehicle climate systems (HVAC, air purification, ventilation). CRITICAL USAGE RULES:\n\n1) SIMPLE ON/OFF (NO SUB-MODE):\n   Use ONLY action and device when user requests basic activation/deactivation without specifying a mode (e.g., 'turn on AC', 'activate air purifier').\n   Examples: {action:'打开', device:'空调'}, {action:'打开', device:'空气净化器'}\n   FORBIDDEN: Including value/feature/position in these cases.\n\n2) MODE SELECTION (SPECIFIC SUB-MODE):\n   - For STANDARD MODES (AQS, cooling, heating, natural wind, refresh mode, etc.):\n        action='打开'/'关闭', device='空调', value=[ENUM TERM]\n   - For AIRFLOW DIRECTION MODES (避人, 对人, 自动扫风):\n        ALSO set feature='风' and position=[LOCATION] if user specifies location.\n\n3) NUMERIC ADJUSTMENTS:\n   action='调到'/'调高'/'调低', device='空调' (temp/wind) or '前挡风'/'后挡风' (defog), feature=[TYPE], value=[NUMBER STRING OR LEVEL STRING].\n\n4) VENT POSITION CONTROL:\n   device='出风口', action='打开'/'关闭', position=[LOCATION]. NO feature/value.\n\n5) DEFROSTER ON/OFF:\n   device='前挡风' (DEFAULT) or '后挡风', action='打开'/'关闭', feature='除雾'. NO value.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "action": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "关闭",
            "打开",
            "调到",
            "调高",
            "调低"
          ]
        },
        "device": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "出风口",
            "前挡风",
            "后挡风",
            "空气净化器",
            "空调"
          ]
        },
        "feature": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "温度",
            "除雾",
            "风"
          ]
        },
        "position": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "主驾",
            "副驾",
            "前排",
            "第一排右侧",
            "第一排左侧",
            "第二排",
            "第二排右侧",
            "第二排左侧",
            "第二排中间",
            "第三排",
            "第三排右侧",
            "第三排左侧",
            "全部",
            "主驾右侧",
            "主驾左侧",
            "副驾右侧",
            "副驾左侧"
          ]
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "AQS",
            "自动",
            "节能模式",
            "制冷",
            "制热",
            "极速升温",
            "极速降温",
            "温度同步",
            "内循环",
            "外循环",
            "自然风",
            "自动扫风",
            "对人",
            "避人",
            "吹头",
            "吹脚",
            "吹窗",
            "吹头吹脚",
            "吹头吹窗",
            "吹脚吹窗",
            "吹头吹脚吹窗",
            "智能除味",
            "守护模式",
            "宠物模式",
            "最低",
